Don't fall down.

1167
01:20:05,547 --> 01:20:10,551
And rule number three:
Whatever you do, never look back.

1168
01:20:10,676 --> 01:20:12,886
Y'all wish me luck.

1169
01:20:12,969 --> 01:20:14,929
Snatch and run, y'all!

1170
